    "name": "DevPulse APIs",
    "description": "DevPulse is an asynchronous incident post-mortem and discussion platform designed for engineering teams.\n\nThis API collection contains endpoints for user authentication, user management, posts, and nested comments. It supports secure user authentication using JWT, post management, threaded discussions, and comment soft deletion.\n\n**Tech Stack:** FastAPI, Python, PostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy, Pydantic, Alembic, JWT Authentication.\n\nThis collection is intended for testing and interacting with the DevPulse backend API.",
